y how many  blind spots  people have that will also vary but we  all have them  and that is why ultimately i am 180  degrees in the opposite direction of  where i thought i was going to end up on  this issue  which is not the position that i thought  i would be coming from which is  these things are not political stop  acting as if they are  no instead these things are political  stop acting as if their absence  isn't political this ultimately is me  venting a little bit at  the discourse which is ultimately me  howling into the wind  i understand that i am a  small youtuber i can't  change the way people are having these  conversations  and i you know even setting aside bad  actors who are going to  twist things for their own purposes  anyways even people talking in good  faith i can't control that conversation  but  i can still put out there and have it on  the record  my stances on these things and try to  get people to understand where i'm  coming from and maybe get them to think  about things in a way they didn't before  the way i've had to do with lots of  things  in my life not just my creative works  there are lots of things i've had to  have my eyes opened about to realize  that my assumption that my normal  isn't political is fundamentally  wrong nothing  is a political deal with it  so there you go  i don't know how much of this is  ultimately going to be helpful for other  people or how much of it is just  me doing this for myself but  i hope you found that interesting  thoughtful  entertaining i don't know whatever your  thoughts are i hope you will drop  something down in the comments  and allow us to talk about it be  respectful that is my one  rule i don't care what your position is  if you're a jerk  to me or anyone else you will be gone  that's how it works  i have a patreon which is how this  channel is able to  exist and it's how i am able to eat it's  what keeps the lights on around here  and in addition to that there are all  the usual things t